146	2008-05-08 14:30:00	2008-05-08 14:30:00	0	Red Potato Salad		Cook potatoes in a sucepan of boiling salted water 15 minutes or until tender.  Meanwhile, make dressing.  Whisk together vinegar, mustard,  and salt and pepper to taste.  Slowly pour in oil, whisking constantly.  Drain potatoes thoroughly, cut into halves or quarters, depending on size, then immediately toss with dressing, herbs, onion and celery.  Let cool.  Makes 4 servings.	RED POTATO SALAD	\N
