287	2020-07-22 15:01:00	2020-11-24 00:48:00	4	Potato Kugel	From Bob's Red Mill	Preheat oven to 350º.\r\rUsing a food processor, grate potatoes.  Put into a large bowl and fill with cold water; set aside.  Using a food processor, grate onion, drain the liquid and set aside.\r\rStrain shredded potatoes and rinse with cold water.  Squeeze out as much water as possible and place back in the bowl.  Pour in the grated onion and toss to combine.  Sprinkle potato starch over mixture and mix well, no lumps.\r\rIn a medium bowl, mix together eggs, salt, pepper and 2 Tbs oil.  Pour egg mixture over potatoes and toss well to combine.\r\rPlace 1 Tbs of oil in a baking dish to coat the bottom.  Pour the potato mixture into the pan and evenly distribute.  Drizzle the remaining 2 Tbs of oil over the top.  Bake 70-75 minutes until browned on top.  Allow to cool for 15 minutes before serving.\r\rGarnish with fresh snipped Chives\r	POTATO KUGEL	1
