296	2021-04-01 12:03:00	2023-09-24 12:49:00	19	Michael’s Round Loaf		Place the cup of whole wheat flour into the mixer bowl and stir in the yeast.  It takes about one minute 45 seconds to heat the water in the microwave.  Add the hot water and let it bubble for a minute or so.\r\rAdd three cups of the white flour and mix thoroughly with the flat beater just until completely incorporated.\r\rRemove the flat beater, add the remaining 2 cups of white flour, and sprinkle the salt on top, gently stirring the salt into the flour before mixing.  Attach the dough hook and mix thoroughly.  After a few minutes, it should be fully mixed and the texture will be smooth.\r\rGently pour the dough into an oiled bowl, cover with a cloth and let rise for 30 minutes to an hour, or until doubled.\r\rKnead gently by folding the edges inward around the bowl, and bringing the bottom of the dough to the top.  Try not to squeeze too much air out.  Cover with cloth again.  Let rise for the second rising about 30 minutes.\r\rPreheat the oven to 450°.\r\rLightly oil a flat pan.  Gently pour the dough onto a floured board and gently shape into a round loaf.  Place it on the pan.\r\rPlace in the preheated oven for 30 to 35 minutes.  Place the loaf on a wire rack or wooden board to cool.  Slice in quarters.	MICHAEL’S ROUND LOAF	1
138	2008-05-08 14:30:00	2024-10-06 12:12:00	2	Zucchini Bread W/Molasses	Marda's recipe	Combine flours, cinnamon, baking soda, baking powder and salt in a mixing bowl. Beat sugar, oil, eggs and molasses in another mixing bowl until well combined.  Add flour mixture; stir just to combine. Stir in zucchini, raisins and nuts. Divide batter between two greased 8x4x2 inch loaf pans. Bake in a 350 oven for 50 to 55 minutes. Cool for 10 minutes on a wire rack. Remove from pans; cool on a wire rack. Wrap and store overnight before slicing . Makes 2 loaves.	ZUCCHINI BREAD W/MOLASSES	0
307	2022-05-14 09:00:00	2022-05-14 09:06:00	7	Smashed Chickpea Salad		1. Add the garbanzo beans to a large bowl and simply mash with a fork until texture appears flaked, almost like tuna.\r\r2. Add the green onion, celery, mayonnaise, mustard, and seasonings to the mashed beans and stir until well combined.\r\r3. For serving, pile high on bread (open faced or as sandwiches) or fill lettuce cups.  Top with your choice of sliced avocado, broccoli sprouts and/or sliced red pepper.  Or serve with crackers as an appetizer.	SMASHED CHICKPEA SALAD	2
4	2008-05-08 14:30:00	2022-05-19 08:06:00	1	Asparagus Soup	Makes a creamy delicious soup	Chop the Asparagus into 1/2" pieces.  Place in a saucepan along with all other ingredients except the evaporated skim milk. Bring to boiling; cover and simmer for 10 to 12 minutes until asparagus is crisp/tender.  Place asparagus mixture in blender and blend on high speed until smooth, and fibers are good and chopped up.  Return to saucepan, add cream and heat without boiling."	ASPARAGUS SOUP	0
