315	2023-11-03 19:47:00	2024-03-20 13:18:00	7	Persimmon Cookies		Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F.\r\rPlace persimmon pulp in a small bowl; stir in baking soda until dissolved and set aside.\r\rSift flour, cinnamon, cloves, nutmeg, and salt into a large bowl; set aside.\r\rBeat sugar and butter with an electric mixer in a separate large bowl until smooth.\r\rBeat in egg and persimmon mixture; add flour mixture and stir until just combined.\r\rFold in raisins and walnuts.\r\rDrop spoonfuls of dough 2 inches apart onto the baking sheets.\r\rBake in the preheated oven until edges are golden, about 15 minutes.\r\rCool on the baking sheet briefly before removing to a wire rack to cool completely.	PERSIMMON COOKIES	1
